WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.876
A new roommate. Do you like cats?

2
00:00:04.326 --> 00:00:09.341
Hi, Mike! This is Paula. I have a flat in Sao Paulo, and I need a roommate.

3
00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:11.138
Hi, Paula! Great!

4
00:00:12.488 --> 00:00:15.831
Do you like cats? I have a cat, Mimi.

5
00:00:16.281 --> 00:00:17.814
Yes, I do! I love cats.

6
00:00:20.064 --> 00:00:20.993
Do you cook?

7
00:00:21.443 --> 00:00:23.254
Yes, I do. I cook dinner every day.

8
00:00:25.504 --> 00:00:27.083
Do you play the guitar at night?

9
00:00:27.533 --> 00:00:29.716
No, I don't. I play in the afternoon.

10
00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:33.173
Do you work from home?

11
00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:35.341
Yes, I do. I'm a writer.

12
00:00:37.591 --> 00:00:40.378
Perfect! Do you want to see the flat on Saturday?

13
00:00:40.828 --> 00:00:42.500
Yes, I do! See you on Saturday!

